flowchart TD
    Start([Worker Polling Tick: Every 5s]) --> QueryDB{Query messages where<br/>status = 'SCHEDULED' and<br/>scheduled_for <= NOW and<br/>campaign is ACTIVE}

    QueryDB -- No Messages Ready --> Sleep[Sleep 5 Seconds] --> Start
    QueryDB -- Message Ready --> Lock[Acquire Atomic DB Lease:<br/>SELECT FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED]

    Lock --> CheckCap{Check Daily Limit:<br/>Total Sent Today < Max Limit?}
    CheckCap -- Cap Exceeded --> Reschedule[Reschedule to Next Business Day 09:00] --> CommitSkip[Commit DB & Release Lock] --> Start

    CheckCap -- Under Limit --> CheckSupp{Is Contact or Domain<br/>in Suppression List?}
    CheckSupp -- Yes --> MarkSupp[Update status = 'SUPPRESSED'] --> CommitSkip

    CheckSupp -- No --> MarkSending[Update status = 'SENDING'<br/>Set worker_lease_until = NOW + 5m]
    MarkSending --> Dispatch[Call Gmail API users.messages.send]

    Dispatch --> Result{API Response}
    Result -- HTTP 200 OK --> MarkSent[Record gmail_message_id & thread_id<br/>Set status = 'SENT'<br/>Set sent_at = NOW]
    MarkSent --> SheetsWrite[Batch Update Google Sheet Status Column]
    SheetsWrite --> ReleaseLock[Commit DB Transaction & Release Lock] --> Start

    Result -- HTTP 429 Rate Limit --> PauseCamp[Pause Campaign<br/>Backoff 15m] --> ReleaseLock
    Result -- HTTP 401 Auth Revoked --> MarkAuthFail[Flag Integration NEEDS_REAUTH<br/>Set status = 'FAILED'] --> ReleaseLock
    Result -- 5xx Network Timeout --> CheckSentBeforeRetry{Query Gmail API for Message-ID<br/>Did email actually dispatch?}
    CheckSentBeforeRetry -- Yes --> MarkSent
    CheckSentBeforeRetry -- No --> Requeue[Increment retry_count<br/>Reset status = 'SCHEDULED'<br/>Set backoff delay] --> ReleaseLock
